        "id": "textbook-not-definition",
        "moduleId": "negate-basics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：not 的真值定义",
        "markdown": "给定一个 statement $P$，我们用 $\\neg P$ 表示 not $P$，读作“非 $P$”。它的定义是：当 $P$ 为真时 $\\neg P$ 为假；当 $P$ 为假时 $\\neg P$ 为真。因此 $\\neg P$ 的真值完全由 $P$ 的真值取反得到：\n\n| $P$ | $\\neg P$ |\n|---|---|\n| 真 | 假 |\n| 假 | 真 |\n\n由这个定义还可直接得到双重否定：$\\neg(\\neg P) \\sim P$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000004"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Basic Logic",
                "Not and Contradiction"
              ],
              "lineStart": 70,
              "lineEnd": 100,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6e23c768a1e9d5903a9995057ac01c85d05786aae5c191b22f26200b39d1aaa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-double-negation",
        "moduleId": "negate-basics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：把否定理解为“翻转真值”",
        "markdown": "否定不是造出一个与原命题无关的新命题，而是把同一个命题的真值翻转一次。翻转两次就回到原处，这正是 $\\neg(\\neg P) \\sim P$ 的直观来源。日常语言里“并非不成立”也往往等价于“成立”，与这条规则一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-not-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-de-morgan",
        "moduleId": "de-morgan",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材：De Morgan 定律",
        "markdown": "对由 connectives 连接起来的 statement 取 not 会变复杂。教材用真值表说明，否定不能逐项分配到合取或析取上，而应得到：\n\n$$\\neg(P \\land Q) \\sim (\\neg P) \\lor (\\neg Q) \\qquad \\neg(P \\lor Q) \\sim (\\neg P) \\land (\\neg Q)$$\n\n这两条称为 De Morgan 定律。教材用实数例子核对：$0 \\le x \\le 1$ 表示 $x \\le 1$ 且 $x \\ge 0$，它的否定是 $x > 1$ 或 $x < 0$，即 $(\\neg P) \\lor (\\neg Q)$，而不是 $(\\neg P) \\land (\\neg Q)$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000004"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Basic Logic",
                "Not and Contradiction"
              ],
              "lineStart": 70,
              "lineEnd": 100,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6e23c768a1e9d5903a9995057ac01c85d05786aae5c191b22f26200b39d1aaa3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-de-morgan-check",
        "moduleId": "de-morgan",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "补充：用真值表核对否定是否“分配”",
        "markdown": "检查否定能否分配，最稳妥的办法是列真值表。取 $P$ 真、$Q$ 假：此时 $\\neg(P \\land Q)$ 为真，而 $(\\neg P) \\land (\\neg Q)$ 为假，两者不同，说明把 $\\neg$ 直接分配到合取上是错误直觉。\n\n可以记成一条规则：$\\neg$ 穿过 $\\land$ 时变成 $\\lor$，穿过 $\\lor$ 时变成 $\\land$，同时两个分量各自取反。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-de-morgan"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-implication-negation",
        "moduleId": "implication-negation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材：蕴含式的否定与常用等价形式",
        "markdown": "教材特别提醒：$\\neg(P \\Rightarrow Q)$ 并不等价于 $P \\Rightarrow \\neg Q$。当 $P$ 为假时，$P \\Rightarrow Q$ 与 $P \\Rightarrow \\neg Q$ 都为真，二者无法区分；真正的反例出现在 $P$ 真而 $Q$ 假时。\n\n正确的等价式是：\n\n$$\\neg(P \\Rightarrow Q) \\sim P \\land (\\neg Q)$$\n\n教材还给出处理蕴含式的常用等价形式：$P \\Rightarrow Q$ 等价于其逆否命题 $(\\neg Q) \\Rightarrow (\\neg P)$，也等价于 $Q \\lor (\\neg P)$。以 De Morgan 定律对 $Q \\lor (\\neg P)$ 取否定，即可得到上面的否定式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
